      "rationale": "Current retrieved compression card, pinned forward175-200 and explicit benchmark section2.3 fallback inspected. Flattened-history tokenization/mixing would change many factors and does not resolve the observed duplicate-match scale/support confound. Original paper detailed text unavailable; no original-method or performance claim.",
